2026-07-15 15:39:21.938 [http-nio-8080-exec-10] INFO  cn.yanque.common.aop.ControllerLogAspect [guid=27191a42459b403aa4ddb0c3a031e43e] - 接口结束: uri=/yq-admin/api/textToSql/route, controller=TextToSqlController#route, cost=18772ms, result={"code":200,"message":"success","data":{"questionType":"query","routeReason":"明确要求统计本月已支付成功的订单数量和总金额，属于数据查询分析类问题","finalAnswer":"已根据当前指标和表结构生成只读 SQL，暂未执行查询。","action":"generate_sql","sql":"SELECT COUNT(*) AS order_count, SUM(p.payment_amount) AS total_amount FROM sale_payment_order p WHERE p.payment_status = 'SUCCESS' AND DATE_FORMAT(p.created_at, '%Y-%m') = DATE_FORMAT(NOW(), '%Y-%m')","reason":"用户需统计本月支付成功的订单数量和总金额；payment_status='SUCCESS' 和 created_at 时间范围可直接从 sale_payment_order 表获取，该表已包含 payment_amount 和 order_no，且业务规则明确支付成功即为 SUCCESS，按 created_at 月份过滤符合要求。","missingInfo":[],"usedTables":["sale_payment_order"],"usedFields":["payment_status","created_at","payment_amount"],"conversationId":"68b0462d-dece-4aa8-945c-3d0fce2655c4","interrupted":false}}
2026-07-15 15:39:26.117 [http-nio-8080-exec-9] INFO  cn.yanque.common.aop.ControllerLogAspect [guid=585a60d4d14141d3b02d89bd36999724] - 接口开始: uri=/yq-admin/api/textToSql/route, httpMethod=POST, controller=TextToSqlController#route, args=[{"name":"req","value":{"userQuestion":"查询各班级当前在读学员人数，按人数降序排列"}}]
2026-07-15 15:39:39.169 [http-nio-8080-exec-9] INFO  cn.yanque.common.aop.ControllerLogAspect [guid=585a60d4d14141d3b02d89bd36999724] - 接口结束: uri=/yq-admin/api/textToSql/route, controller=TextToSqlController#route, cost=13051ms, result={"code":200,"message":"success","data":{"questionType":"query","routeReason":"明确要求查询各班级当前在读学员人数并按人数降序排列，属于数据统计分析类查询","finalAnswer":"已根据当前指标和表结构生成只读 SQL，暂未执行查询。","action":"generate_sql","sql":"SELECT c.id AS class_id, c.class_term, COUNT(s.id) AS student_count FROM edu_class c LEFT JOIN edu_student s ON c.id = s.class_id WHERE s.id IS NOT NULL GROUP BY c.id, c.class_term ORDER BY student_count DESC","reason":"用户需查询各班级当前在读学员人数并按人数降序排列；'当前在读'可合理理解为 edu_student 表中 class_id 非空且已关联班级的记录（即实际在班学员），无需额外状态过滤（因表中无明确 '在读' 状态字段，且 class_status 字段值如 WAITING/TEACHING/FINISHED 不直接等价于学员在读状态）；通过 LEFT JOIN edu_student 并 COUNT(s.id) + GROUP BY 可准确统计每班学员数。","missingInfo":[],"usedTables":["edu_class","edu_student"],"usedFields":["edu_class.id","edu_class.class_term","edu_student.id","edu_student.class_id"],"conversationId":"f37e421c-48f1-4ff2-b57b-74084374f6a2","interrupted":false}}
