2026-07-15 15:41:40.199 [http-nio-8080-exec-8] INFO  cn.yanque.common.aop.ControllerLogAspect [guid=3d996c5ae592444687925742d008bb47] - 接口结束: uri=/yq-admin/api/textToSql/route, controller=TextToSqlController#route, cost=11686ms, result={"code":200,"message":"success","data":{"questionType":"query","routeReason":"明确要求统计最近30天各课程的作业提交率，属于对业务数据的查询分析需求","finalAnswer":"请补充以下信息：提交率的分子定义；提交率的分母定义；最近30天的时间基准字段（publish_date/submit_time/deadline）。","action":"need_clarification","reason":"作业提交率需明确定义：是按‘每个作业’还是‘每个课程下所有作业汇总’计算？分子（已提交学生数）和分母（应交学生总数）的统计口径不明确，例如是否使用 homework_assignment.student_count_snapshot 作为分母，或需关联班级/学生表动态计算；且‘最近30天’指作业发布时间、截止时间还是提交时间？需用户澄清。","missingInfo":["提交率的分子定义","提交率的分母定义","最近30天的时间基准字段（publish_date/submit_time/deadline）"],"usedTables":[],"usedFields":[],"conversationId":"01f8ebb8-d1a0-4f1e-8fc0-67374d4e1192","interrupted":true}}
2026-07-15 15:43:45.798 [http-nio-8080-exec-1] INFO  cn.yanque.common.aop.ControllerLogAspect [guid=e2b0d2c8115c4f8486d74a6748d6acb0] - 接口开始: uri=/yq-admin/api/textToSql/continue, httpMethod=POST, controller=TextToSqlController#continueQuestion, args=[{"name":"req","value":{"conversationId":"01f8ebb8-d1a0-4f1e-8fc0-67374d4e1192","userAnswer":"提交率：提交的作业/作业总数；最近30天是指以当前时间向前推30天"}}]
2026-07-15 15:43:58.032 [http-nio-8080-exec-1] INFO  cn.yanque.common.aop.ControllerLogAspect [guid=e2b0d2c8115c4f8486d74a6748d6acb0] - 接口结束: uri=/yq-admin/api/textToSql/continue, controller=TextToSqlController#continueQuestion, cost=12233ms, result={"code":200,"message":"success","data":{"questionType":"query","routeReason":"明确要求统计最近30天各课程的作业提交率，属于对业务数据的查询分析需求","finalAnswer":"已根据当前指标和表结构生成只读 SQL，暂未执行查询。","action":"generate_sql","sql":"SELECT \n  c.course_name,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT hs.assignment_id) AS submitted_assignment_count,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT ha.id) AS total_assignment_count,\n  ROUND(COUNT(DISTINCT hs.assignment_id) * 100.0 / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT ha.id), 0), 2) AS submission_rate\nFROM edu_course c\nLEFT JOIN homework_assignment ha ON c.id = ha.course_id AND ha.publish_date >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 30 DAY)\nLEFT JOIN homework_submission hs ON ha.id = hs.assignment_id AND hs.submit_time >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 30 DAY)\nGROUP BY c.id, c.course_name\nORDER BY c.course_name","reason":"可基于已提供表结构计算提交率：作业总数=最近30天发布的作业数（homework_assignment.publish_date），提交数=最近30天提交的作业记录数（homework_submission.submit_time），通过LEFT JOIN + COUNT(DISTINCT)避免重复计数，分母加NULLIF防除零。","missingInfo":[],"usedTables":["edu_course","homework_assignment","homework_submission"],"usedFields":["c.course_name","c.id","ha.id","ha.course_id","ha.publish_date","hs.assignment_id","hs.submit_time"],"conversationId":"01f8ebb8-d1a0-4f1e-8fc0-67374d4e1192","interrupted":false}}
